2026-09-22 00:45:01,569 | INFO | db_sentinel | AUDIT event=QUERY_EXECUTED reason=Query executed successfully. sql=SELECT p.name AS pathway_name,
       COUNT(DISTINCT gm.fbgn_id) AS total_genes,
       COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN pm.human_orthologs IS NOT NULL AND jsonb_array_length(pm.human_orthologs) > 0 THEN gm.fbgn_id END) AS genes_with_human_orthologs,
